  "note": "3.0 G3：共同活动（docs/PLAN-3.0.md 附录 C.7）。done_when：user_said_any [词…] / model（她回复里 practice.step_done）/ action 动作名。",
  "world_words": ["星", "铜钩", "守夜", "松子", "烤"],
